==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*4 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*10 [[Doge]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Aku Doges are at a low level magnification as to allow you to just bruteforce your way through their shields. You'll want to save your shield piercers anyway, as those are few and far between.

The Zackie Pengs, despite being at a somewhat high magnification, are single target, and don't pose much of a threat, so if one is worried, just bring more meatshields.

